{"product_id":"the-pants-of-perspective-one-womans-3-000-kilometre-running-adventure-through-the-wilds-of-new-zealand","title":"The Pants Of Perspective: One woman's 3,000 kilometre running adventure through the wilds of New Zealand","description":"\u003cp\u003eWhat Amazon readers are saying about The Pants of Perspective:‰чЙ‰чЙ‰чЙ‰чЙ‰чЙ \"A thrilling coming of age journey that'll make you yearn for adventure\" - RUNNER'S WORLD‰чЙ‰чЙ‰чЙ‰чЙ‰чЙ \"Beaming with limitless positivity and ambition\" - WOMEN'S RUNNING‰чЙ‰чЙ‰чЙ‰чЙ‰чЙ ‰ЫќA story that inspires others to blaze a trail.\" - THE GUARDIAN‰чЙ‰чЙ‰чЙ‰чЙ‰чЙ \"Travel writing at its best!\"‰чЙ‰чЙ‰чЙ‰чЙ‰чЙ \"Hilarious and inspiring.\"‰чЙ‰чЙ‰чЙ‰чЙ‰чЙ \"So down to earth. Full of passion and vulnerability\"‰чЙ‰чЙ‰чЙ‰чЙ‰чЙ \"Wow. Wow. Wow. Pure inspiration.\"‰чЙ‰чЙ‰чЙ‰чЙ‰чЙ \"I don't normally feel moved to review books, but this one blew me away! I was gripped from begining to end.\"‰чЙ‰чЙ‰чЙ‰чЙ‰чЙ \"I felt like I was running right alongside her.\"BOOK DESCRIPTION\"When I ran, I ran for pleasure. I didn‰ЫЄt run for times, to win, to impress: I ran for me. When I ran my bum cheeks rubbed together, so much so that if I was going on a long run I‰ЫЄd have to ‰Ычlube up‰ЫЄ. I maintained that I was not a ‰Ычreal‰ЫЄ runner ‰ЫТ I just liked to run so that I could eat cake.\"Anna was never anything like those ‰Ычreal‰ЫЄ runners on telly ‰ЫТ all spindly limbs, tiny shorts and split times ‰ЫТ but when she read about New Zealand‰ЫЄs 3,000-kilometre-long Te Araroa Trail, she began to wonder‰Ы? perhaps being a ‰Ычreal‰ЫЄ runner was overrated.Maybe she could just run it anyway?Travelling alone through New Zealand‰ЫЄs backcountry for 148 days, she scrambled through forests, along ridge-lines, over mountain passes, along beaches and across swollen rivers. Running up to 52 kilometres in a day, she slept wild most nights, and was taken into the homes and hearts of the kiwi people in between.The Pants of Perspective is a witty, colourful and at times painfully raw account of a journey to the edge of what a woman believes herself to be capable of. It is a coming-of-age story which will lead you on a roller coaster ride through fear, vulnerability courage and failure. For anyone who has ever dreamt of taking on a great challenge, but felt too afraid to begin ‰ЫТ this story is for you.‰Єґ The books in the 'Anna's Adventures' series can be read in any order ‰Єґ\u003cbr\u003e\nDimensions: 127 x 203\u003cbr\u003e\nAuthor: Anna McNuff\u003cbr\u003e\nISBN: 9781999765804\u003cbr\u003e\nFormat: Paperback\u003cbr\u003e\nPages: 438\u003c\/p\u003e","brand":"bookloopbook.com","offers":[{"title":"Default Title","offer_id":45199367700633,"sku":"9RE9781999765804","price":10.0,"currency_code":"AED","in_stock":true}],"thumbnail_url":"\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0580\/5696\/6297\/files\/67c9c1671ab56_The_20Pants_20Of_20Perspective-_20One_20woman_s_203_000_20kilometre_20running_20adventure_20through_20the_20wilds_20of_20New_20Zealand_20Anna_20McNuff.jpg?v=1741352588","url":"https:\/\/bookloopbook.com\/products\/the-pants-of-perspective-one-womans-3-000-kilometre-running-adventure-through-the-wilds-of-new-zealand","provider":"Dubai - Buy Used\/Second-Hand Books - Book Loop Book","version":"1.0","type":"link"}